$HOME/BMH-OS/BMH Training Course/Thinkific/ch06/Beyond the Basics_ Why _Discovery_ is the Secret Sauce to Closing Real Estate Deals.md:7:Let me be blunt: if you are just collecting data, you are a clerk, not a deal maker. The gap between a stagnant pipeline and a high-revenue machine is a high-level skill called **Discovery**. It is the process of moving past the property specifications to uncover the raw, human story behind the deed. Without it, you aren’t selling; you’re just filing paperwork for a deal that will likely never happen.
$HOME/BMH-OS/BMH Training Course/Thinkific/ch06/Beyond the Basics_ Why _Discovery_ is the Secret Sauce to Closing Real Estate Deals.md:44:The handoff is Stage 4 of the pipeline, and it is make-or-break. I have seen countless deals die here because the seller feels they are being "bounced around randomly between strangers." When that happens, their guard goes right back up, and you lose everything you built. 
$HOME/BMH-OS/BMH Training Course/Thinkific/ch06/Beyond the Basics_ Why _Discovery_ is the Secret Sauce to Closing Real Estate Deals.md:76:Look at your current pipeline. Are you just collecting data, or are you actually discovering the human story behind the deed?
